A wait takes the bits through a capability without RIGHT_R,
so a driver given the power to announce something could consume the announcement too;
a call goes through only a capability with the rights its operation needs.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a call went through a capability without the rights its operation needs

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -618,9 +618,6 @@ static int op_notification(struct thread *t, uint32_t slot, const struct cap *ca
         return slot_store(t, arg[2], &sub, slot_node(t, slot));
     }
     case OP_NOTIFY_WAIT:
-        if (!(cap->rights & RIGHT_R)) {
-            return KERR_NO_RIGHTS;
-        }
         if (ntfn->bits != 0) {
             arg[1] = ntfn->bits;
             ntfn->bits = 0;
